{"title": "Counterspell", "pageid": 2737, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Counterspell", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 3 Spells", "Abjuration spells", "Spells that gain benefits at higher levels", "Reactions", "Bugs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Counterspell.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Counterspell.webp/300px-Counterspell.webp, /w/images/8/83/Counterspell.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Counterspell.webp/300px-Counterspell.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Counterspell.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Counterspell </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 3 abjuration spell</a>. It allows spellcasters to interrupt another caster's spellcasting, causing it to fail and have no effect.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Try to stop a spell being cast. \n</p><p>If it is higher level than the spell slot you used to Counterspell, you must make a <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">check</a> using your spellcasting ability<sup><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Bugs\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup> to prevent it. The check's difficulty is equal to 10 plus the level of the spell you are trying to counter.\n</p>\nThis spell can be cast while you are <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Silenced\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\">Silenced</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/28px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/42px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/28px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 3 Spell Slot</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Counterspell can be upcast to counter spells of higher levels without requiring a check.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_Counterspell</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_Counterspell\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_Counterspell\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 5: <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">Warlock</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a></li><li> Class level 6: <a href=\"/wiki/College_of_Lore\" title=\"College of Lore\">College of Lore</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Secrets\" title=\"Magical Secrets\">Magical Secrets</a>)</li><li> Class level 10: <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Secrets\" title=\"Magical Secrets\">Magical Secrets</a>)</li></ul>\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Staff_of_Interruption\" title=\"Staff of Interruption\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Staff_of_Interruption\" title=\"Staff of Interruption\">Staff of Interruption</a></span> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>There are no scrolls available for <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">wizards</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Even a failed Counterspell feeds an <a href=\"/wiki/Abjuration_School\" title=\"Abjuration School\">Abjuration School</a> Wizard's <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Ward\" title=\"Arcane Ward\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp/20px-Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp/40px-Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Ward\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp/20px-Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Ward\" title=\"Arcane Ward\">Arcane Ward</a>.</li>\n<li>When a scroll is successfully counterspelled the scroll is not consumed.</li>\n<li>Cantrips can also be counterspelled.</li>\n<li>Counterspell cannot be counterspelled</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>When attempting to Counterspell a spell of a higher level, the Counterspell caster's <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png/25px-Intelligence_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png/38px-Intelligence_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png/50px-Intelligence_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Intelligence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png/25px-Intelligence_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> modifier is used instead of their spellcasting ability modifier as the tooltip states.<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>Arcane Ward can only be fed up to 3 charges, regardless of spell Level used, due to how an additional hidden Counterspell is cast based on success/failure.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Counterspell\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Counterspell\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Counterspell\">Counterspell</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-url::before{content:\"External links\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-text::before{content:\"Literature\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-note::before{content:\"Notes\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}</style><div class=\"reflist refs-nogroup\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">From the definition of <code>TryCounterspellHigherLevel(level)</code> in <code>Mods/Shared/Scripts/thoth/helpers/CommonConditions.khn</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?iid=Mods/Shared/Scripts/thoth/helpers/CommonConditions.khn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?iid=Mods/Shared/Scripts/thoth/helpers/CommonConditions.khn\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>:\n\n<details class=\"details--root wikicollapse\"><summary>Show code</summary>\n<pre>function TryCounterspellHigherLevel(level)\n    local spellPowerLevel = SpellPowerLevelEqualOrLessThan(level)\n    if not spellPowerLevel.Result then\n        local counterspellDC = 10 + context.HitDescription.SpellPowerLevel\n        local st = AbilityCheck(Ability.Intelligence, counterspellDC, false, false, 0, context.Observer, context.Observer)\n        return ConditionResult(st.Result,{},{},st.Chance)\n    end\n    return ConditionResult(true,{},{},1.0)\nend\n</pre></details></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714233950\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.116 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.123 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3173/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 40896/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 16812/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 2/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2627/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.040/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1592125/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  104.684      1 -total\n 80.69%   84.467      1 Template:Feature_page\n 67.62%   70.789     39 Template:Trim\n 16.55%   17.324      1 Template:Reflist\n 15.68%   16.418      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 11.05%   11.571      5 Template:Icon_text\n 10.68%   11.184      1 Template:SmCond\n 10.13%   10.605      4 Template:Icon_link\n  8.60%    9.001      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n  8.11%    8.490      1 Template:Resource\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:2737-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714233950 and revision id 393612. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}